part civ_4
  tally 1
  law
  note "CIV-4 · Co-ownership. Each co-owner bears the costs and takes the income of the thing by their share (.1); one who paid more than their share has a claim on the others for the excess, each for their share; rent collected by one is owed to the others for their shares (.2); no interest unless agreed (.3)."
  note "No figure: the households' cost-sharing defs apply it."

source civ_4 "Civil and Family Code, CIV-4 Co-ownership (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version civ4_v1
  cite civ_4
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-03-01
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "CIV-4 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-03-01; governs co-ownership from 2018-01-01."
